# Harrier Strix, a 1/1 flyer for {U}: its enters trigger may tap any permanent, even one of Bot1's own - here the Memnite.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Memnite
Harrier Strix
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Harrier Strix.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Target(Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Harrier Strix.Keywords = Flying
? Bot1.Battlefield.Harrier Strix.Power = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Harrier Strix.Toughness = 1

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Harrier Strix.Tapped = false
